       bark_nk_check('SELECT a, b FROM bark_rme WHERE (a, b) > (' || k || ', 5) ORDER BY a, b DESC')
FROM (VALUES (3), (11)) v(k);
 bark_nk_check | bark_nk_check 
---------------+---------------
 Forward ok    | Backward ok
 Forward ok    | Backward ok
(2 rows)

